      "@type": "VisualMaterial",
      "instance_name": "child",
      "label": "a young child",
      "description": "A young child, likely of African American descent, is kneeling on a patterned rug. The child is wearing a large cowboy hat, a light-colored long-sleeved shirt, and cowboy boots with decorative patterns. The child's hands are clasped together in a prayer-like gesture, resting on a bed covered with a quilted blanket. The child's posture and expression suggest innocence and reverence, contrasting with the humorous and satirical text overlaid on the image.",
