      "instance_name": "cowboy_culture",
      "label": "Cowboy Culture",
      "description": "The child in the image is dressed in cowboy attire, including a large cowboy hat and boots, which is a cultural symbol associated with American frontier life and Western traditions. This visual element, combined with the prayerful pose, creates a contrast that is part of the meme's humor, requiring knowledge of cowboy culture to fully appreciate the juxtaposition.",
