      "label": "Religious Language and Phrases",
      "description": "The text uses phrases like 'dear lord,' 'thank you,' and 'amen,' which are common in Christian prayer. Understanding the context of these phrases as religious expressions is necessary to interpret the meme's satirical tone, which ironically uses religious language to make a humorous, factually incorrect claim.",
      "belongsToAnalysis": {
